      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. (a) Pursuant to Chapters 764 and 960 of the Laws of 1970 and subdivision 1 of section B3-36.3 of the Administrative Code (L.1964, ch. 954), the reduced-rate-of contribution factor shall be five percent in the case of all members of the Uniformed Correction Force, as defined by Law 1964, Chapter 954, who elected the optional plan of retirement provided for by such Chapter pursuant to its terms or pursuant to such Chapter 764 and who were members of the New York City Employees' Retirement System under such plan immediately prior to the commencement date of the 1970-1971 increased-take-home-pay period.",
